necessary agreement with the state Department of Revenue concerning the
collection and administration of the tax imposed in K.C.C. 4A.501.020.  (Ord.
18973 § 10, 2019).</span></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
