tax notice - notices of taxes, fees and changes.</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>            4A.550.120    Property
tax notice - design and contents.</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>            4A.550.130    Property
tax notice - mailing - beginning date.</span></p>

