</table>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>            B.  For the
purpose of this section, &quot;replacement pole&quot; means a new utility pole
replacing an existing utility pole in the county right-of-way with no increase
in the total number of utility poles in the right-of-way.  Replacement poles
provide extra capacity to support attached wireless telecommunications
facilities.</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>            C.  The amount
of the annual use payments established by subsection A. of this section shall
be automatically adjusted annually, beginning January 1, 2018, and every year
thereafter, using the U.S. Department of Labor, Bureau of Labor Statistics
Consumer January through December Price Index for All Urban Consumers
(&quot;CPI-U&quot;) for the Seattle-Tacoma-Bremerton Statistical Metropolitan
Area for the year preceding the prior calendar year of the agreement's
implementation.  However, if the CPI-U is negative, there will be no
adjustment. In the event the CPI-U is no longer published, a reliable
government or other nonpartisan index of inflation selected by the county shall
be used to calculate the adjusted amounts.  (Ord. 18410 § 2, 2016:  Ord. 17691
§ 7, 2013:  Ord. 17515 § 13, 2013).</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>&nbsp;</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>            <b>4A.675.070 
Utility construction work and installation, and other uses, upon, along, over,
under or across any public place that is not a right-of-way fee.</b></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>            A.  The fee
for the administrative costs and expenses of processing the application for
utility construction work and installation, and other uses upon, along, over,
under or across any public place in the county that is not dedicated as
right-of-way is five hundred dollars.</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>            B.  The real
estate services section of the facilities management division may assess a
surcharge to recover costs as specified in K.C.C. 14.46.080.A.</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>            C.  The
inspection fee to be paid to the department managing the property shall be an
amount based on the time spent on the job by inspectors during or after
construction.  (Ord. 17691 § 7, 2013:  Ord. 17515 § 15, 2013).</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>&nbsp;</span></p>

<h1><a name="_Toc319916877"></a><a name="_Toc319916939"></a><a
name="_Toc319924488"></a><a name="_Toc54697866"><span style='font-size:12.0pt'>4A.680           SHERIFF</span></a></h1>

<p class=Technical4><span style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;
letter-spacing:-.1pt;font-weight:normal'>&nbsp;</span></p>

<p class=Technical4><span style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;
letter-spacing:-.1pt'>Sections:</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;
letter-spacing:-.1pt'>            4A.680.010    Civil unit fees.</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;
letter-spacing:-.1pt'>            4A.680.020    Body worn camera video - fees
for reviewing and redacting.</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;
letter-spacing:-.1pt'>&nbsp;</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal><span style='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;
letter-spacing:-.1pt'>&nbsp;</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.1pt'>            <b>4A.680.010 
Civil unit fees.</b></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>            The following fees apply as
provided in this chapter:</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>            A.  Service of civil process,
service, summons and complaint, notice and complaint, summons and petition and
notice of small claim:</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>              1.  Serve one defendant                                                                           $43.00</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>              2.  Serve two or more defendants,
same address                               $58.00</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>              3.  All returns                                                                                              $35.00</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>              4.  Nonresident returns                                                                             $35.00</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>              5.  Notary fee                                                                                              $10.00</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>              6.  Mileage (per mile)                                       Federal
standard mileage rate</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>            B.  Attachment, writ – personal
property:</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>              1.  Levy, per hour                                                                                      $97.00</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>              2.  Serve, each defendant                                                                        $58.00</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>              3.  Return to court                                                                                      $35.00</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>              4.  Mileage (per mile)                                       Federal
standard mileage rate</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>            C.  Attachment, writ – real
property:</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>              1.  Levy (per hour)                                                                                     $97.00</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>              2.  Notice of levy                                                                                          $8.00</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>                        Per Location                                                                                        $2.00</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>              3.  Filing with auditor and
auditor's filing fee                                         $43.00</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>              4.  Serve defendant (if required)                                                             $58.00</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>              5.  Return to court                                                                                      $35.00</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>              6.  Mileage (per mile)                                       Federal
standard mileage rate</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>            D.  Execution – personal property:</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>              1.  Levy (per hour)                                                                                     $97.00</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>              2.  Posting of each notice                                                                         $23.00</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>              3.  Conducting sale (per hour)                                                                 $97.00</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>              4.  Bill of sale (each)                                                                                 $97.00</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>              5.  Return to court                                                                                      $35.00</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>              6.  Serve defendant                                                                                   $58.00</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>              7.  Serve notice (defendant)                                                                    $58.00</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>              8.  Postponement notice (each)                                                              $23.00</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>              9.  Mileage (per mile)                                       Federal
standard mileage rate</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>              10.  Mailing                                                                    Actual
costs of postage</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>            E.  Warrants:</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>              1.  Serve (each)                                                                                         $97.00</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>              2.  Return to court                                                                                      $35.00</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>              3.  Mileage (per mile)                                       Federal
standard mileage rate</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>            F.  Subpoena:</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>              1.  Serve (each)                                                                                         $58.00</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>              2.  Return to court                                                                                      $35.00</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>              3.  Mileage                                                         Federal
standard mileage rate</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>            G.  Postage for mailing, required
by statute</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>                        whether regular, certified
or registered:               Actual cost of postage</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>            H.  Mileage fee, each mile actually
and</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>                        necessarily traveled in
going to or</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>                        returning from any place
of service</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>                        or attempted service:                                   Federal
standard mileage rate</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>            I.  Execution – order of sale of
real property:</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>              1.  Levy (per hour)                                                                                     $97.00</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>              2.  Notice to publisher                                                                                 $2.00</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>              3.  Recording with auditor                                                                        $43.00</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>              4.  Conducting sale (per hour)                                                                 $97.00</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>              5.  Certificate of sale                                                                                 $97.00</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>              6.  Return to court                                                                                      $34.00</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>              7.  Posting of notice (each)                                                                      $23.00</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>              8.  Affidavit of posting                                                                               $23.00</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>              9.  Postponement (each notice)                                                              $23.00</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>              10.  Mileage (per mile)                                     Federal
standard mileage rate</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>              11.  Mailing                                                                      Actual
cost of postage</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>            J.  Writ of garnishment:</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>              1.  Serve garnishee                                                                                   $58.00</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>              2.  Return to court                                                                                      $34.00</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>              3.  Serve defendant (if required)                                                             $58.00</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>              4.  Mileage (per mile)                                       Federal
standard mileage rate</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>              5.  Mailing                                                                        Actual
cost of postage</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>            K.  Writ of replevin – affidavit,
claim and delivery:</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>              1.  Serve defendant with writ –
affidavit and bond                               $58.00</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>              2.  Serve summons and complaint
(one)                                               $43.00</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>              3.  Serve summons and complaint
(two or more)                                $58.00</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>              4.  Levy (per hour)                                                                                     $97.00</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>              5.  Return to court                                                                                      $34.00</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>              6.  Mileage (per hour)                                      Federal
standard mileage rate</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>            L.  Writ of restitution or writ of
assistance, or both:</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>              1.  Service with aid of county                                                                $128.00</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>              2.  Cost per hour after first
hour                                                              $97.00</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>              3.  Return to court                                                                                      $34.00</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>              4.  Mileage (per mile)                                       Federal
standard mileage rate</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>            M.  Redemption:</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>              1.  Serve notice of intent                                                                          $58.00</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>              2.  Certificate of redemption                                                                    $97.00</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>            N.  Deed issuance                                                                                       $97.00</span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='text-align:justify'><span style='font-size:12.0pt;
font-family:"Arial",sans-serif'>            O.  Internal-only criminal history
